*INV:	www .
%com:	the word@f forms in this manuscript refer to people . Ema is the Hebrew word for Mother , Aba is Hebrew for Father and Bubi is Hebrew for grandmother . Bubi is a member of their household .
%exp:	Davidal , Cookie and d@f are MOT's names for CHI and Stish seems to be either another family member or friend of CHI .
%tim:	15:29:53
